{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07327","headline":"睢阳赠李司仓 · 刘长卿","name":"睢阳赠李司仓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白露变时候，蛬声暮啾啾。\n飘飘洛阳客，惆怅梁园秋。\n只爲乏生计，尔来成远游。\n一身不家食，万事从人求。\n且喜接余论，足堪资小留。\n寒城落日後，砧杵令人愁。\n归路岁时尽，长河朝夕流。\n非君深意愿，谁复能相忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}